  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sigma baseline EU Integr</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sigma baseline EU Integr</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet samfinansieras av DFID och Sida p&#xe5; beg&#xe4;ran av OECD/Sigma i en situation d&#xe4;r extern finansiering beh&#xf6;vs f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra projektet. Syftet &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rse Ukraina med en serie Sigma Baselines som normalt g&#xf6;rs f&#xf6;r kandidatl&#xe4;nder. Dessa studier j&#xe4;mf&#xf6;r situationen p&#xe5; ett antal omr&#xe5;den med god praxis inom EU samt med EU:s aquis communautaire.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a co-financed exercise by DFID and Sida at the request of the OECD/Sigma in a situation where external bridge funding is necessary for the project to be possible.The aim is to provide Ukraine with a series of OECD/Sigma Baseline Assessments that are normally provided for EU candidate countries.</narrative>
  </description>
